Integration\", \"Downtime(Mins)\": \"0\", \"Internal Status\": \"Closed\", \"Date/Time Closed\": \"2026-07-29 22:53:00\", \"Date/Time Opened\": \"2026-07-29 21:34:00\", \"Incident Report status\": \"Yes\", \"Mean Time to Detect (MTTD)\": \"2\"}, \"source_row\": 71, \"excel_serials\": {\"Closed Date\": \"46232\", \"Date/Time Closed\": \"46232.953472222223\", \"Date/Time Opened\": \"46232.898611111108\"}, \"source_sha256\": \"e1b96eac153502b4612d23e4e5de6f2048f9d33f2626ba55ac75bf8cc5683d02\"}',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-18 10:51:48','2026-09-08 09:39:53'),(692,'INC-225',NULL,'Alert \'MESSRVPILOT - Critical Memory and Stagnant Request Alert [MESInsights - XPA]’ was fired','Alert \'MESSRVPILOT - Critical Memory and Stagnant Request Alert [MESInsights - XPA]’ was fired','critical','closed',14,'Mrunal Rajkar',14,'NGC',3,'MES Application',NULL,'NGC - MES',21,'Application',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-08-21 23:48','2026-08-21 23:48:00','2026-08-21 23:48:00.000000','2026-08-22 00:09','2026-08-22 00:09:00','2026-08-22 00:09:00.000000','2026-08-22','GMT','Etc/UTC',0,0,0,NULL,'Memory Consumption was above 2GB.','We have restarted the MES application using a pipeline. Currently the application is up and running.','By OC Team','00135906',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'21m',21,'2026-08-22 13:09:50','2026-09-09 14:11:49'),(698,'INC-227',NULL,'Coralogix Alert on magic /  Christie Digital K8s- Pod Memory Utilization Exceeded 6 GB','Hello Team,\n\nWe have received a Coralogix alert regarding high memory utilization in the Magic / Christie Digital Kubernetes environment, where pod memory usage exceeded 6 GB.\n\nUpon review, we observed that the mosquitto-5454b9975-dkljx pod in the Christie Digital environment is consuming a high amount of memory.','critical','closed',22,'Aatif Shaikh',22,'Christie Digital',12,'mosquitto',NULL,'Infrastructure',1,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-08-23 23:26','2026-08-23 23:26:00','2026-08-24 03:26:00.000000','2026-08-27 04:00','2026-08-27 04:00:00','2026-08-27 08:00:00.000000','2026-08-27','EST','America/New_York',0,0,0,NULL,'The pod memory incresed above 6 GB due to excesive mqtt, mosquitto logs and page cache.','We have deleted the logs and cleared the page cache memory','By OC Team','00135784',NULL,'2m',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'76h 34m',4594,'2026-08-24 04:29:46','2026-09-08 22:38:18'),(703,'INC-228','00135798','Christie Digital_EC2 Low Free Disk Space','We have received an alert for free disk space low on Christie Digital Production EC2 environment. There is low disk space for the C: Drive on Christie Digital Production EC2 environment.','critical','closed',3,'Rohan Shelar',3,'Christie Digital',12,'EC2',NULL,'Infrastructure',1,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-08-25 04:02','2026-08-25 04:02:00','2026-08-25 08:02:00.000000','2026-08-25 05:02','2026-08-25 05:02:00','2026-08-25 09:02:00.000000','2026-08-25','EST','America/New_York',0,0,0,NULL,'When investigated we observed that xpi logs were consuming 29 GB of disk space from following directory - C:\\xpi\\xpi4141\\Runtime\\Logs\\java','We created the windows batch script which will clear logs files older than 30 days. Also, we have created a windows task for scheduled cleanup. The current free space is 21GB. The issue has been resolved.','By OC Team','00135798',NULL,'5m',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'40m',40,'2026-08-25 11:32:12','2026-09-08 09:39:53'),(712,'INC-300',NULL,'Azure: Activated Severity: 0 FTD No Historian Read','We would like to inform you about a recent occurrence of a \'No Historian Read\' alert at FTD.\nOur team has conducted an investigation and prepared a detailed report to provide you with all the necessary information.\n \nPlease find the following details:\n \n- Plant Name: FTD[FTD-APPSVR]\n- \'No Historian Read\' Alert Details: [NGCXPILAVM1]\n- Incident Timestamp: Aug 28, 2026, 07:54 AM GMT\n- Duration: 40 minutes plant FTD is down.\n- Impact: Data is not flowing into FactoryEye for FTD while this alert is active.','critical','closed',2,'Babai Chatterjee',2,'NGC',3,'Historian',NULL,'Historian',8,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-08-28 07:54','2026-08-28 07:54:00','2026-08-28 07:54:00.000000','2026-08-28 11:25','2026-08-28 11:25:00','2026-08-28 11:25:00.000000','2026-08-28','GMT','Etc/UTC',3,15,195,'3h 15m','No Data was flowing into factoryeye for plant FTP','Resolved Automatically from plant side','By System','00135913',NULL,'2m',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'3h 31m',211,'2026-08-28 08:38:55','2026-09-09 14:31:35'),(730,'INC-302',NULL,'Alert \'Redis Container Instance Restarted’ was fired','<div>Hello Team,</div><div><br></div><div>We had received Critical Alert - Redis Container Instance Restarted.</div><div><br></div><div>Details:</div><div>Timestamp: 30/08/2026 06:33 AM IST</div><div>Customer Name: National Gypsum Company (NGC)</div>','critical','closed',22,'Aatif Shaikh',22,'NGC',3,'NGC MDE',NULL,'Redis',10,'Application',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"type\": \"comment\", \"action\": \"commented\", \"author\": \"Aatif Shaikh\", \"detail\": \"@Rohan Shelar Please Check\", \"author_id\": 22, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-01T05:21:17.163Z\"}, {\"type\": \"comment\", \"action\": \"commented\", \"author\": \"Rohan Shelar\", \"detail\": \"Hi @Aatif Shaikh I verified the details and they seem to be correct.\", \"author_id\": 3, \"created_at\": \"2026-09-01T06:35:14.963Z\"}]','2026-08-30 01:02','2026-08-30 01:02:00','2026-08-30 01:02:00.000000','2026-08-30 02:02','2026-08-30 02:02:00','2026-08-30 02:02:00.000000','2026-08-30','GMT','Etc/UTC',1,0,60,'1h','Redis was automatically restarted.','Redis was automatically restarted but having issues so manual restart was needed. After manually restarting the Redis instance it failed to start successfully. After few attempts to restart the Redis instance, it started normally and issue was resolved. We also executed the configuration commands.','By OC Team','00135898',NULL,'5m',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1h',60,'2026-09-01 05:15:12','2026-09-08 22:36:17'),(731,'INC-303',NULL,'Coralogix Alert on magic /  Toridoll- Average K8s Node Memory Utilization Higher than 80%','<div>Hello Team,</div><div>We had received the alert on \"Coralogix Alert on magic / Toridoll- Average K8s Node Memory Utilization Higher than 80%\"</div>','critical','closed',10,'Avinash Mamale',22,'TORIDOLL',20,'Toridoll',NULL,'Infrastructure',1,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-08-31 12:23','2026-08-31 12:23:00','2026-08-31 03:23:00.000000','2026-08-31 13:08','2026-08-31 13:08:00','2026-08-31 04:08:00.000000','2026-08-31','JST','Asia/Tokyo',0,0,0,NULL,'We found that multiple project pods were using high memory, which increased the overall node memory usage.&nbsp;','Undeploy and redeploy the affected projects','By Customer','00135899',NULL,'5m',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'45m',45,'2026-09-01 05:29:20','2026-09-08 22:47:44'),(736,'INC-304',NULL,'Coralogix Alert on magic / SMC- K8s- Pod Memory Utilization Exceeded 6GB','We\'ve detected that the query has exceeded 6442450944 (6Gb) for project Brazil pod','critical','closed',3,'Rohan Shelar',3,'SMC',13,'Brazil',NULL,'Infrastructure',1,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-03 06:07','2026-09-03 06:07:00','2026-09-03 10:07:00.000000','2026-09-03 06:12','2026-09-03 06:12:00','2026-09-03 10:12:00.000000','2026-09-03','EST','America/New_York',0,0,0,NULL,'Bazil project pod was consuming more than 6 GB of memory.','Team has redeployed the project which resolved the issue.','By OC Team',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5m',5,'2026-09-03 10:17:39','2026-09-03 13:24:26'),(737,'INC-305','00135879','Azure: Activated Severity: 0 MTH No Historian Read','<div><div><div><div><div>Azure: Activated Severity: 0 MTH No Historian Read</div></div></div></div></div>','critical','closed',14,'Mrunal Rajkar',14,'NGC',3,'Historian',NULL,'Historian',8,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-04 17:51','2026-09-04 17:51:00','2026-09-04 17:51:00.000000','2026-09-05 03:12','2026-09-05 03:12:00','2026-09-05 03:12:00.000000','2026-09-05','GMT','Etc/UTC',9,21,561,'9h 21m','<!--StartFragment-->The NGC team is working with the plant currently. There may have been a fiber cut there<!--EndFragment-->','The Alert got auto resolved.','By System','00135879',NULL,'2m',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-05 03:29:04','2026-09-05 05:40:10'),(739,'INC-306',NULL,'Alert \'MESSRVPILOT - Critical Memory and Stagnant Request Alert [MESInsights - XPA]’ was fired','Alert \'MESSRVPILOT - Critical Memory and Stagnant Request Alert [MESInsights - XPA]’ was fired','critical','closed',19,'Sushant Tadke',19,'NGC',3,'MESSRVPILOT',NULL,'NGC - MES',21,'Application',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-05 06:44','2026-09-05 06:44:00','2026-09-05 06:44:00.000000','2026-09-05 07:30','2026-09-05 07:30:00','2026-09-05 07:30:00.000000','2026-09-05','GMT','Etc/UTC',0,0,0,NULL,'High stagnant requests.','We have restarted the MES application using pipeline. Currently the application is up and running.&nbsp;<br>The application is up and running and The alert is resolved','By OC Team','00135880',NULL,'2m',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'41m',41,'2026-09-05 06:51:17','2026-09-05 07:49:11'),(743,'INC-307',NULL,'Coralogix Alert on magic / VBC_EC2 High Memory Usage','We\'ve detected that the project is taking more than 4gb memory.','critical','closed',2,'Babai Chatterjee',2,'VBC',22,'ShopifyToSyspro, Amazon',NULL,'Integration',17,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-06 09:00','2026-09-06 09:00:00','2026-09-06 16:00:00.000000','2026-09-06 09:20','2026-09-06 09:20:00','2026-09-06 16:20:00.000000','2026-09-06','MST','Etc/GMT+7',0,0,0,NULL,'The project ShopifyToSyspro and Amazon project was consuming more than 2gb which cause the EC2 memory went above 90%','We have restarted the projects which resolved the alert','By OC Team',NULL,NULL,'2m',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5m',5,'2026-09-07 09:53:17','2026-09-07 10:08:09'),(744,'INC-308',NULL,'Alert \'Critical Alert - MESInsights He