ards ensuring a swift resolution.<br><br>Thank you for your attention to this matter.','critical','closed',19,'Sushant Tadke',19,'NGC',3,'Historian',NULL,'Historian',8,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-12 10:23','2026-09-12 10:23:00','2026-09-12 10:23:00.000000','2026-09-12 11:13','2026-09-12 11:13:00','2026-09-12 11:13:00.000000','2026-09-12','GMT','Etc/UTC',0,0,0,NULL,'<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">The\niHistorian Data Archiver x64 services did not restart automatically after\npatching.&nbsp; Data flow has resumed.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Resolved by customer.<br><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">The\niHistorian Data Archiver x64 services did not restart automatically after\npatching.&nbsp; Data flow has resumed.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','By Customer',NULL,NULL,'2m',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'50m',50,'2026-09-12 10:41:54','2026-09-12 11:21:39'),(758,'INC-319',NULL,'Alert \'MESSRVPILOT - Critical Memory and Stagnant Request Alert [MESInsights - XPA]’ was fired','Alert \'MESSRVPILOT - Critical Memory and Stagnant Request Alert [MESInsights - XPA]’ was fired','critical','closed',19,'Sushant Tadke',19,'NGC',3,'MESSRVPILOT',NULL,'NGC - MES',21,'Application',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-12 13:03','2026-09-12 13:03:00','2026-09-12 13:03:00.000000','2026-09-12 13:31','2026-09-12 13:31:00','2026-09-12 13:31:00.000000','2026-09-12','GMT','Etc/UTC',0,0,0,NULL,'HIgh stagnent Request&nbsp;','<div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Aptos, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">We have restarted the MES application using a pipeline. Currently the application is up and running.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Aptos, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The application is up and running and The alert is resolved.</span></font></div>','By OC Team',NULL,NULL,'2m',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'28m',28,'2026-09-12 13:14:59','2026-09-12 13:34:57'),(759,'INC-320',NULL,'Azure: Activated Severity: 0 CIN