to inform you about a recent occurrence of a \'No Historian Read\' alert at SHO.<br>Our team has conducted an investigation and prepared a detailed report to provide you with all the necessary information.<br><br>Please find the following details:<br><br>- Plant Name: SHO[SHO-APPSVR]<br>- \'No Historian Read\' Alert Details: [NGCXPILAVM1]<br><br>- Duration: 60 minutes plant SHO is down.<br>- Impact: Data is not flowing into FactoryEye for SHO while this alert is active.<br><br>Please find attached a screenshot for your reference.<br><br><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"image.png\"><br><br>- Steps Taken:<br><br>We have identified that we were not reading data from the Historian server and are not able to ping.<br>We have identified that we cannot read data from the Historian server. We ask that someone on the NGC technical support team check the server’s network access, power to the server and/or the plant, the Historian licensing is active and lastly restart the server if all else fails.<br>Please inform us when you have a resolution to the issue, and/or you have verified that the server is operational.<br>We understand the importance of resolving this matter promptly, and we appreciate your collaboration towards ensuring a swift resolution.<br><br>Thank you for your attention to this matter.','critical','closed',14,'Mrunal Rajkar',14,'NGC',3,'Historian',NULL,'Historian',8,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-23 13:59','2026-09-23 13:59:00','2026-09-23 13:59:00.000000','2026-09-23 14:44','2026-09-23 14:44:00','2026-09-23 14:44:00.000000','2026-09-23','GMT','Etc/UTC',0,45,45,'45m','Following is the update from customer :<br><br><!--StartFragment-->NGC FactoryEye team should have notified that site is undergoing scheduled work and will be offline for a bit.&nbsp; APPSVR will be restored once power and network is restored.<!--EndFragment-->','Following is the update from customer :<br><br>NGC FactoryEye team should have notified that site is undergoing scheduled work and will be offline for a bit.&nbsp; APPSVR will be restored once power and network is restored.','By Customer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'45m',45,'2026-09-23 14:12:59','2026-09-23 15:09:42'),(770,'INC-330',NULL,'Coralogix Alert on magic / Ives Bank-Kubernetes Pods Restarting','We\'ve detected that the query has exceeded 0 for over 0% of the following','critical','in_progress',14,'Mrunal Rajkar',14,'Ives Bank',8,'mgc-iveank-proion-ingress-nginx-controller-864b9b48f6-lhgpv',NULL,'Infrastructure',1,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-24 13:10','2026-09-24 13:10:00','2026-09-24 17:10:00.000000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'EST','America/New_York',0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-24 17:27:30','2026-09-24 17:27:30');
