c509a875195b','alerts@coralogix.com::coralogix alert on magic / san diego airport- local agent not running','We are yet to deploy the healthcheck post MCM upgrade. Ignore the alert',0,2,'2026-09-21 16:15:27'),(11,'fae70a4607b391eaf9ccfa1271c220a0f6b6bf3142fd43440d6321a2feeab646','alerts@coralogix.com::coralogix alert on magic / tilebar- k8s- pod memory utilization exceeded 6gb::2026-09-24','This alert has been resolved',1,2,'2026-09-24 19:59:42'),(12,'f5b3d0e777e40da7e258f38ee85ebf06dacfd28f796b753659c350993e4e985d','alerts@coralogix.com::coralogix alert on magic / tilebar- k8s- pod memory utilization exceeded 6gb::2026-09-22','This alert has been resolved',1,2,'2026-09-24 20:00:21'),(13,'4316d497521e9068ae8e75d0856143e7db470f1dd41640a31a4911217c44cb4b','alerts@coralogix.com::coralogix alert on magic / san diego airport- local agent not running::2026-09-21','This alerr resolved after modifying the alert query condition',1,2,'2026-09-24 20:22:03'),(14,'bd61f55c9e36b0144b7edc3a9c82f3cd130a6e067e0a69186631d94f4f9ef4a5','jira::CD-171::2026-09-23','THis issue has been resolved',1,2,'2026-09-24 20:34:35');
